            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189092906?u=54fee3540223ffdaeb53d9d68199b9013d29e09e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated <code class=\"notranslate\">gcadapter-oc-kmod</code> installation to prevent configuration rebuild failure due to a missing <code class=\"notranslate\">.cer</code> (the failure is also mentioned <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/575192#issuecomment-6312334247\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/575192/hovercard\">here</a>). Fix follows emilazy's patching instructions from <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/575192#issuecomment-6235759112\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/575192/hovercard\">this comment</a>. Built on my machine and tested the patched version on my system configuration (running <code class=\"notranslate\">linuxPackages_latest</code> on nixos-unstable <code class=\"notranslate\">02c087f3fe67</code>).</p>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=